{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Overview</strong><br>The demo includes the full game experience\u2014minus the campaign mode. Gameplay is limited to\u00a05 in-game days, and players can build up to\u00a0Tier 2 structures only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Eurekas</strong><br><i>Eurekas</i>\u00a0is a real-time strategy colony sim in a world rooted in ancient magic. A tribe of settlers arrives on a mysterious island, eager to claim it as their own\u2014but the land has other plans. Nature pushes back. Spirits awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll manage your colony in real time, harness arcane magic, and craft clever strategies to withstand the island\u2019s fury. Expand your territory, confront supernatural threats, and earn the favor of your gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a god, your power lies in shaping the world\u2019s tiles\u2014your colonists, however, live their own lives, making choices independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your colony flourish\u2014or be reclaimed by the wild?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997220?t=1757545085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997220?t=1757545085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997220/86f174c2347a883fdff5d4921b67728304a5b3b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757545085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997220/86f174c2347a883fdff5d4921b67728304a5b3b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757545085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"de